Third-party components
================================================================================

The Apache-2.0 licence above covers Talkie's own source code. It does not, and
cannot, grant rights to the third-party software Talkie depends on. Three of
those dependencies carry terms that a user of this repository has to meet
themselves.

The full list of every dependency and its licence is generated from the
dependency tree and shown inside the app under Settings -> Licences. It is also
committed at src/renderer/src/generated/notices.json, and regenerated by
`npm run notices`.

Licence texts that no package carries -- the GPL, version 2 and version 3, and
ONNX Runtime's notices -- are kept in licences/ and installed with every build
at Talkie.app/Contents/Resources/licences/, where a recipient can read them.

